**Describe the bug**

The filepath in `rich.traceback` should have clickable links (like `rich.logging.RichHandler`).

I think we should add clickable links here:
https://github.com/Textualize/rich/blob/43d3b04725ab9731727fb1126e35980c62f32377/rich/traceback.py#L698-L706

**Code:**

```python
import rich.traceback
from rich.console import Console

console = Console(record=True)
rich.traceback.install(console=console)
try:
    raise NotImplementedError
except:
    console.print_exception()
console.save_html("console.html", clear=False)
console.save_svg("console.svg", clear=False)
```

